      <activity id="f2ca3f80-9221-52b4-82aa-bef759edd240" activityNameId="993c9c00-4eb0-5fda-ab95-8acc12d0119e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, U=1.1 W/m2K, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, U=1.1 W/m2K, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). 1m2 (wall opening) of wood-metal window frame weighs 23kg. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: f8f0bf02-f71f-3630-8a1a-39c3e44116b2
Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of casement and frame. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f8f0bf02-f71f-3630-8a1a-39c3e44116b2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
